				<B>
				<SPAN CLASS="larger">
				<BR>
De signis
				</SPAN>
				<BR>
by
				<BR>
				<SPAN CLASS="larger">
Theophrastus
				</SPAN>
				</B>
				<BR>
as published in Vol. II
				<BR>
of the
Loeb Classical Library edition
of the <I>Enquiry into Plants</I>,
1926
