E/Roman/Texts/Theophrastus/De_signis*.html#ref2
"onMouseOver="return Ebox(INARRAY,BackRef,WIDTH,175)"
onMouseOut="nd();">2</A>
<SPAN LANG="el" CLASS="Greek">ἀντιμεθίστανται</SPAN>. ? <SPAN LANG="el" CLASS="Greek">ἀντιμεθίσταται</SPAN>.


<P CLASS="ivy">❦</P>


	<P CLASS="justify">
	<A CLASS="note" ID="note3" HREF="
E/Roman/Texts/Theophrastus/De_signis*.html#ref3
"onMouseOver="return Ebox(INARRAY,BackRef,WIDTH,175)"
onMouseOut="nd();">3</A>
	<A HREF="
L/Roman/Texts/Pliny_the_Elder/5*.html#140
	"TARGET="Pliny"
onMouseOver="return Ebox(INARRAY,Pliny,WIDTH,205)"
onMouseOut="nd();">
Plin. 5.140</A>. Of Matriketas nothing is known.


<P CLASS="ivy">❦</P>


	<P CLASS="justify">
	<A CLASS="note" ID="note4" HREF="
E/Roman/Texts/Theophrastus/De_signis*.html#ref4
"onMouseOver="return Ebox(INARRAY,BackRef,WIDTH,175)"
onMouseOut="nd();">4</A>
Said
	<A HREF="
L/Roman/Texts/Pliny_the_Elder/2*.html#31
	"TARGET="Pliny"
onMouseOver="return Ebox(INARRAY,Pliny,WIDTH,205)"
onMouseOut="nd();">
(Plin. 2.31)
	</A>
to have first recognised the Ram and the Archer.
	<A HREF="
E/Roman/Texts/Athenaeus/7A*.html#T278b
	"TARGET="Athenaeus_E"
onMouseOver="return Ebox(INARRAY,1,WIDTH,175)"
onMouseOut="nd();">
Athen. (7 278<SPAN CLASS="small">B</SPAN>)
	</A>
connects him with Tenedos.


<P CLASS="ivy">❦</P>


	<P CLASS="justify">
	<A CLASS="note" ID="note5" HREF="
E/Roman/Texts/Theophrastus/De_signis*.html#ref5
"onMouseOver="return Ebox(INARRAY,BackRef,WIDTH,175)"
onMouseOut="nd();">5</A>
Called 'the great year': <I>cf.</I> <A HREF="
https://penelope.uchicago.edu/aelian/varhist10.html#chap7
	"TARGET="offsite"
onMouseOver="return Ebox(INARRAY,2,WIDTH,175)"
onMouseOut="nd();">Aelian. <I>V. H.</I> 10.7</A>. <SPAN LANG="el" CLASS="Greek">τὸν τοῦ ἑνὸς δέοντα εἴκοσιν ἐνιαυτῶν</SPAN> <SPAN CLASS="emend">&#60;<SPAN LANG="el" CLASS="Greek">κύκλον</SPAN>&#62;</SPAN> conj. Sch. <SPAN LANG="el" CLASS="Greek">ἐνιαυτὸν</SPAN> conj. W.


<P CLASS="ivy">❦</P>


	<P CLASS="justify">
	<A CLASS="note" ID="note6" HREF="
E/Roman/Texts/Theophrastus/De_signis*.html#ref6
"onMouseOver="return Ebox(INARRAY,BackRef,WIDTH,175)"
onMouseOut="nd();">6</A>
<SPAN LANG="el" CLASS="Greek">τὰ</SPAN> seems necessary. ? <SPAN LANG="el" CLASS="Greek">κύρια τὰ</SPAN>.


<P CLASS="ivy">❦</P>


	<P CLASS="justify">
	<A CLASS="note" ID="note7" HREF="
E/Roman/Texts/Theophrastus/De_signis*.html#ref7
"onMouseOver="return Ebox(INARRAY,BackRef,WIDTH,175)"
