	<A CLASS="note" ID="note23" HREF="
E/Roman/Texts/Theophrastus/De_signis*.html#ref23
"onMouseOver="return Ebox(INARRAY,BackRef,WIDTH,175)"
onMouseOut="nd();">23</A>
	<A HREF="
L/Roman/Texts/Pliny_the_Elder/18*.html#364
	"TARGET="Pliny"
onMouseOver="return Ebox(INARRAY,Pliny,WIDTH,205)"
onMouseOut="nd();">
Plin. 18.364</A>;
	<A HREF="
https://www.hs-augsburg.de/~harsch/Chronologia/Lsante01/Vergilius/ver_ge01.html
	"TARGET="offsite"
onMouseOver="return Ebox(EClickHere+'Book 1<BR>of the Georgics'+Lat2+LatSearch+'bucula</SPAN>',WIDTH,195)"
onMouseOut="nd();">
Verg. <I>Georg.</I> 1.375</A>.


<P CLASS="ivy">❦</P>


	<P CLASS="justify">
	<A CLASS="note" ID="note24" HREF="
E/Roman/Texts/Theophrastus/De_signis*.html#ref24
"onMouseOver="return Ebox(INARRAY,BackRef,WIDTH,175)"
onMouseOut="nd();">24</A>
<SPAN LANG="el" CLASS="Greek">ἐπιρροιζήσῃ</SPAN>. Sc. with his wings probably; not, as LS. 'croaks.'
	<A HREF="
L/Roman/Texts/Pliny_the_Elder/18*.html#362
	"TARGET="Pliny"
onMouseOver="return Ebox(INARRAY,Pliny,WIDTH,205)"
onMouseOut="nd();">
Plin. (18.362)
	</A>
seems to have had a fuller text, or to have drawn also on some other authority.


<P CLASS="ivy">❦</P>


	<P CLASS="justify">
	<A CLASS="note" ID="note25" HREF="
E/Roman/Texts/Theophrastus/De_signis*.html#ref25
"onMouseOver="return Ebox(INARRAY,BackRef,WIDTH,175)"
onMouseOut="nd();">25</A>
<SPAN LANG="el" CLASS="Greek">ὑετῶν ὄντων</SPAN> can hardly mean 'while it is raining.'


<P CLASS="ivy">❦</P>


	<P CLASS="justify">
	<A CLASS="note" ID="note26" HREF="
E/Roman/Texts/Theophrastus/De_signis*.html#ref26
"onMouseOver="return Ebox(INARRAY,BackRef,WIDTH,175)"
onMouseOut="nd();">26</A>
<SPAN LANG="el" CLASS="Greek">ἱερακίζωσιν</SPAN>. ? 'hover like hawks.' However, Arat. 231<!--</A>ARATUS--> understood it to refer to the voice: so LS.


<P CLASS="ivy">❦</P>


	<P CLASS="justify">
	<A CLASS="note" ID="note27" HREF="
E/Roman/Texts/Theophrastus/De_signis*.html#ref27
"onMouseOver="return Ebox(INARRAY,BackRef,WIDTH,175)"
onMouseOut="nd();">27</A>
<SPAN LANG="el" CLASS="Greek">ἐπιρροιβδῃ</SPAN>. Exact sense uncertain. <I>cf.</I> Soph. <I>Ant.</I> 1004.


<P CLASS="ivy">❦</P>


	<P CLASS="justify">
