E/Roman/Texts/Theophrastus/De_signis*.html#ref28
"onMouseOver="return Ebox(INARRAY,BackRef,WIDTH,175)"
onMouseOut="nd();">28</A>
<SPAN LANG="el" CLASS="Greek">ἥμερος</SPAN>. ? <SPAN LANG="el" CLASS="Greek">ἡ ἥμερος</SPAN>.


<P CLASS="ivy">❦</P>


	<P CLASS="justify">
