E/Roman/Texts/Theophrastus/De_signis*.html#ref29
"onMouseOver="return Ebox(INARRAY,BackRef,WIDTH,175)"
onMouseOut="nd();">29</A>
Sch. cites
	<A HREF="
L/Roman/Texts/Pliny_the_Elder/18*.html#364
	"TARGET="Pliny"
onMouseOver="return Ebox(INARRAY,Pliny,WIDTH,205)"
onMouseOut="nd();">
Plin. 18.364</A>, <SPAN LANG="la" CLASS="Latin">vermes terreni erumpentes</SPAN>, as representing this, which seems doubtful.


