L/Roman/Texts/Pliny_the_Elder/2*.html#129
	"TARGET="Pliny"
onMouseOver="return Ebox(INARRAY,Pliny,WIDTH,205)"
onMouseOut="nd();">
Plin. 2.129</A>.


<P CLASS="ivy">❦</P>


	<P CLASS="justify">
