E/Roman/Texts/Theophrastus/De_signis*.html#ref68
"onMouseOver="return Ebox(INARRAY,BackRef,WIDTH,175)"
onMouseOut="nd();">68</A>
So Furl. renders: W. inserts <SPAN LANG="el" CLASS="Greek">μὴ</SPAN> after <SPAN LANG="el" CLASS="Greek">σελήνη</SPAN>.


