E/Roman/Texts/Theophrastus/De_signis*.html#ref76
"onMouseOver="return Ebox(INARRAY,BackRef,WIDTH,175)"
onMouseOut="nd();">76</A>
I have bracketed <SPAN LANG="el" CLASS="Greek">ἢ βορέας</SPAN> as probably a gloss on <SPAN LANG="el" CLASS="Greek">ἀπαρκτίας</SPAN>; <SPAN LANG="el" CLASS="Greek">ἢ</SPAN> is difficult to account for otherwise. See diagram.


