<I>i.e.</I> and the succeeding day will be more or less stormy in proportion. <SPAN LANG="el" CLASS="Greek">ἀπολειφθείη</SPAN>. ? <SPAN LANG="el" CLASS="Greek">ἀποληφθείη</SPAN> = 'may be obscured.'


