<SPAN LANG="el" CLASS="Greek">ὦτα κρούων</SPAN> doubtful. Sch. suggests <SPAN LANG="el" CLASS="Greek">οὖδας</SPAN> for <SPAN LANG="el" CLASS="Greek">ὦτα</SPAN>.


