<SPAN LANG="el" CLASS="Greek">ἀκρωρίας</SPAN>. <I>cf.</I> <A HREF="
E/Roman/Texts/Theophrastus/De_signis*.html#21
"onMouseOver="return Ebox(INARRAY,5,WIDTH,140)"
onMouseOut="nd();">21</A>.


<P CLASS="ivy">❦</P>


