	<P CLASS="justify">
	<A CLASS="note" ID="note95" HREF="
E/Roman/Texts/Theophrastus/De_signis*.html#ref95
"onMouseOver="return Ebox(INARRAY,BackRef,WIDTH,175)"
onMouseOut="nd();">95</A>
