"onMouseOver="return Ebox(INARRAY,5,WIDTH,140)"
onMouseOut="nd();">23</A>, <A HREF="
E/Roman/Texts/Theophrastus/De_signis*.html#43
"onMouseOver="return Ebox(INARRAY,5,WIDTH,140)"
onMouseOut="nd();">43</A>.


<P CLASS="ivy">❦</P>


	<P CLASS="justify">
	<A CLASS="note" ID="note107" HREF="
E/Roman/Texts/Theophrastus/De_signis*.html#ref107
"onMouseOver="return Ebox(INARRAY,BackRef,WIDTH,175)"
onMouseOut="nd();">107</A>
