E/Roman/Texts/Theophrastus/De_signis*.html#22
"onMouseOver="return Ebox(INARRAY,5,WIDTH,140)"
onMouseOut="nd();">22</A>, <A HREF="
E/Roman/Texts/Theophrastus/De_signis*.html#31
"onMouseOver="return Ebox(INARRAY,5,WIDTH,140)"
onMouseOut="nd();">31</A>;
	<A HREF="
L/Roman/Texts/Pliny_the_Elder/18*.html#345
	"TARGET="Pliny"
onMouseOver="return Ebox(INARRAY,Pliny,WIDTH,205)"
onMouseOut="nd();">
Plin. 18.345</A>; Arist. <I>Meteor.</I> 3.3.


<P CLASS="ivy">❦</P>


	<P CLASS="justify">
	<A CLASS="note" ID="note108" HREF="
E/Roman/Texts/Theophrastus/De_signis*.html#ref108
"onMouseOver="return Ebox(INARRAY,BackRef,WIDTH,175)"
onMouseOut="nd();">108</A>
<SPAN LANG="el" CLASS="Greek">κηλάδες</SPAN> I conj. <I>cf.</I> <A HREF="
E/Roman/Texts/Theophrastus/De_signis*.html#31
"onMouseOver="return Ebox(INARRAY,5,WIDTH,140)"
onMouseOut="nd();">31</A>, to which this statement answers. <SPAN LANG="el" CLASS="Greek">κοιλάδες</SPAN> <SPAN CLASS="small">MSS.</SPAN>


<P CLASS="ivy">❦</P>


	<P CLASS="justify">
	<A CLASS="note" ID="note109" HREF="
