Plin. 18.357</A>. <I>cf.</I> <A HREF="
https://www.hs-augsburg.de/~harsch/Chronologia/Lsante01/Vergilius/ver_ge01.html
	"TARGET="offsite"
onMouseOver="return Ebox(EClickHere+'Book 1<BR>of the Georgics'+Lat2+LatSearch+'nebulae</SPAN>',WIDTH,195)"
onMouseOut="nd();">Verg. <I>Georg.</I> 1.401</A>.


<P CLASS="ivy">❦</P>


	<P CLASS="justify">
