	"TARGET="Pliny"
onMouseOver="return Ebox(INARRAY,Pliny,WIDTH,205)"
onMouseOut="nd();">
Plin. 18.362</A>.


<P CLASS="ivy">❦</P>


	<P CLASS="justify">
	<A CLASS="note" ID="note112" HREF="
E/Roman/Texts/Theophrastus/De_signis*.html#ref112
"onMouseOver="return Ebox(INARRAY,BackRef,WIDTH,175)"
onMouseOut="nd();">112</A>
<SPAN LANG="el" CLASS="Greek">ἐν χειμῶνι</SPAN>. ? 'in winter.' The same ambiguity occurs in many places: the sense seems fixed here by the next sentence.


<P CLASS="ivy">❦</P>


	<P CLASS="justify">
	<A CLASS="note" ID="note113" HREF="
E/Roman/Texts/Theophrastus/De_signis*.html#ref113
"onMouseOver="return Ebox(INARRAY,BackRef,WIDTH,175)"
onMouseOut="nd();">113</A>
I have marked a lacuna: the answer to <SPAN LANG="el" CLASS="Greek">μὲν</SPAN> is missing, presumably a statement about the significance of <I>more than one</I> raven. <I>cf.</I> <A HREF="
https://www.hs-augsburg.de/~harsch/Chronologia/Lsante01/Vergilius/ver_ge01.html
	"TARGET="offsite"
onMouseOver="return Ebox(EClickHere+'Book 1<BR>of the Georgics'+Lat2+LatSearch+'ter gutture</SPAN>',WIDTH,195)"
onMouseOut="nd();">Verg. <I>Georg.</I> 1.410</A>.


