"onMouseOver="return Ebox(INARRAY,BackRef,WIDTH,175)"
onMouseOut="nd();">118</A>
<SPAN LANG="el" CLASS="Greek">ἐκβαίνῃ</SPAN> I conj.; <I>cf.</I> <I>H. P.</I> 7.13.6<!--</A>THEOPHRASTUS:HP-->; <SPAN LANG="el" CLASS="Greek">κλίνῃ</SPAN> <SPAN CLASS="small">MSS.</SPAN>


