<P CLASS="ivy">❦</P>


	<P CLASS="justify">
	<A CLASS="note" ID="note121" HREF="
E/Roman/Texts/Theophrastus/De_signis*.html#ref121
"onMouseOver="return Ebox(INARRAY,BackRef,WIDTH,175)"
onMouseOut="nd();">121</A>
Text seems doubtful, as cold weather was included above.


<P CLASS="ivy">❦</P>


	<P CLASS="justify">
	<A CLASS="note" ID="note122" HREF="
E/Roman/Texts/Theophrastus/De_signis*.html#ref122
"onMouseOver="return Ebox(INARRAY,BackRef,WIDTH,175)"
onMouseOut="nd();">122</A>
The text of this sentence can hardly be sound. <SPAN LANG="el" CLASS="Greek">σημαίνειν</SPAN> has no subject and <SPAN LANG="el" CLASS="Greek">ταῖς ἰσημερίαις καὶ τροπαῖς</SPAN> no construction.



